  "uncertainty": "The 2013 acquisition agreement identifies Nash Holdings LLC as the acquiring entity of the Post Business, and reporting confirms the newspaper was transferred to Nash Holdings. Although WP Company LLC was listed among subsidiaries of the seller in the 2013 purchase agreement, the dossier directly documents the newspaper transfer to Nash Holdings LLC, which functions as the ultimate corporate parent entity under controlling owner Jeff Bezos."
